  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You speak a word of Void power, and one creature within range is wracked with agonizing pain. It makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, it takes Psychic damage equal to 1d10 plus your spellcasting ability modifier and is cursed for the duration; on a success, it only takes half as much damage.</p><p>While cursed, the target takes 1d10 Psychic damage at the start of each of its turns. It repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The initial damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-zq9eqksxwqjJzWyw\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use <em>Agony</em> at the start of each of the cursed target’s turns, and delete the effect when it succeeds on <em>Repeat Save</em>.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
